		<preamble GUID="_baa7b4c8-1ff7-408e-917b-f903483be5dd" eId="preamble"><?DMS-Component componentId="1ff1cf0b-7e02-436c-9d35-4553bda7df37" seriesId="f6dcb404-7d79-4248-bbd1-e96c908d79dd" versionNumber="1"?>
			
			<formula GUID="_5201c6a7-783c-4c71-a8ae-af022cf50335" eId="preamble__enactingWords" name="enactingText">
				<p>The Secretary of State makes this <ref class="placeholder" href="#varDocSubType" />—</p>
				<tblock GUID="_3c549074-6281-4f87-a8b2-63e3d8568191" class="para1" eId="preamble__enactingWords__para_a">
					<num>(a)</num>
					<p>in exercise of the powers conferred by section 22 of the Petroleum Act 1987<authorialNote GUID="_86540498-5164-4568-b52d-824840ee74a7" class="footnote" eId="fnote_1" marker="1">
							<p>1987 c. 12.</p>
						</authorialNote>; and</p>
				</tblock>
				<tblock GUID="_ef319d50-a7fe-49c8-b213-7a37cf416ddd" class="para1" eId="preamble__enactingWords__para_b">
					<num>(b)</num>
					<p>for the purpose of giving effect to proposals submitted by the Health and Safety Executive under section 24(2A)<authorialNote GUID="_88f8adf6-daac-44b5-8fce-86e82116ce06" class="footnote" eId="fnote_2" marker="2">
							<p>Section 24(2A) was inserted by S.I. 1993/1823 and amended by S.I. 2008/960.</p>
						</authorialNote> of that Act.</p>
				</tblock>
			</formula>
		</preamble>
		<body><?DMS-Component componentId="a2b2950a-cbe9-4979-b14e-c6bc34493c05" seriesId="90975a2a-60db-42fa-8025-1c3908964ed7" versionNumber="1"?>
			
			<article GUID="_8fdfa2cb-a754-46b0-8c0f-d593e6687bc4" class="prov1" eId="art_1"><?DMS-Component componentId="330057c8-a2c2-47e2-b28c-c90710e62385" seriesId="26261976-f75b-401c-9c4f-aad45eaf3415" versionNumber="1"?>
				
				<heading GUID="_06ba2aa4-0558-4151-9af9-b153389c3735" eId="art_1__hdg">Citation and commencement</heading>
				<num>1.</num>
				<paragraph GUID="_70faafe9-04f6-4978-95ec-8c25b2b58bb4" class="prov2" eId="art_1__para_1">
					<num>(1)</num>
					<content>
						<p>This Order may be cited as the Offshore Installations (Safety Zones) Order 2023.</p>
					</content>
				</paragraph>
				<paragraph GUID="_5b8876ea-fb68-490e-a356-6728abaf6a70" class="prov2" eId="art_1__para_2">
					<num>(2)</num>
					<content>
						<p>This Order comes into force 21 days after the day on which it is made.</p>
					</content>
				</paragraph>
			</article>
			<article GUID="_4de081a0-b541-43b9-84ff-d6867f663a9c" class="prov1" eId="art_2"><?DMS-Component componentId="fc00c4a1-6e4f-4de5-9573-5b60eade9988" seriesId="ee12c1e8-08f5-426d-a14e-b1f8a4256002" versionNumber="1"?>
				
				<heading GUID="_166b2472-95c4-415d-9e98-0e47bd3d81cf" eId="art_2__hdg">Establishment of safety zones</heading>
				<num>2.</num>
				<content>
					<p>A safety zone is established around each installation specified in column 1 of the table in the Schedule (being an installation stationed in waters to which subsection (7) of section 21 of the Petroleum Act 1987 applies) having a radius of five hundred metres, as respects that installation, from the point which has the co-ordinates of latitude and longitude according to the World Geodetic System 1984<authorialNote GUID="_d14ab0b3-5270-467c-bd1b-be75ce9032a2" class="footnote" eId="fnote_3" marker="3">
							<p>The World Geodetic System 1984 (“WGS 84”) defines a reference frame for the Earth, for use in geodesy and navigation. It was developed by the United States’ National Geospatial-Intelligence Agency and is maintained by it. WGS 84 is defined at paragraph 2.1 of the NGA Standardization Document, Department of Defense, World Geodetic System 1984 (updated 8 July 2014) (https://earth-info.nga.mil/index.php?dir=wgs84&amp;action=wgs84#tab_wgs84-res). Hard-copies are available upon request from the offices of the Health and Safety Executive, Aberdeen International Business Park (AIBP), Building 2, Level 1, Dyce Drive, Dyce, Aberdeen AB21 0BR.</p>
						</authorialNote> specified in columns 2 and 3 of the table in the Schedule.</p>
				</content>
			</article>
			<article GUID="_7be74b5d-e192-413f-a659-92de635a0239" class="prov1" eId="art_3"><?DMS-Component componentId="9f054141-d48d-423d-a002-d5f211ca1a60" seriesId="4b5f2c9e-cf91-443b-bef9-cf9ef2d225bd" versionNumber="1"?>
				
				<heading GUID="_ba875b42-7cec-463a-adfa-fef1d97ffb54" eId="art_3__hdg">Amendment of the Offshore Installations (Safety Zones) Order 1997</heading>
				<num>3.</num>
				<paragraph GUID="_8854e5af-a1bc-4266-b900-be85d891e574" class="prov2" eId="art_3__para_1">
					<num>(1)</num>
					<content>
						<p>The Offshore Installations (Safety Zones) Order 1997<authorialNote GUID="_71e83d55-0164-4ac8-8e8e-61786bd64194" class="footnote" eId="fnote_4" marker="4">
								<p>S.I. 1997/735, to which there are amendments not relevant to this Order.</p>
							</authorialNote> is amended as follows.</p>
					</content>
				</paragraph>
				<paragraph GUID="_cc182b55-467e-4b44-93c3-28d519945140" class="prov2" eId="art_3__para_2">
					<num>(2)</num>
					<content>
						<p>In Schedule 1 (safety zones), omit the entry relating to “Orwell Subsea Structure”.</p>
					</content>
				</paragraph>
			</article>
			<article GUID="_42e3669c-c196-43da-9b38-7a8d3a1284b7" class="prov1" eId="art_4"><?DMS-Component componentId="56bc56d2-e9b2-4b6c-adf2-616af2a97413" seriesId="c850bbdd-46d6-48e0-a25a-ad44084c9d49" versionNumber="1"?>
				
				<heading GUID="_2a0bb6a0-abb2-40c8-8252-d8ef0a0d7e1c" eId="art_4__hdg">Amendment of the Offshore Installations (Safety Zones) Order 2013</heading>
				<num>4.</num>
				<paragraph GUID="_d57630b6-42e9-44f7-8eb9-437b6811766d" class="prov2" eId="art_4__para_1">
					<num>(1)</num>
					<content>
						<p>The Offshore Installations (Safety Zones) Order 2013<authorialNote GUID="_06b7f2e0-0b6c-4bca-b1d4-d0f86a7c6032" class="footnote" eId="fnote_5" marker="5">
								<p>S.I. 2013/1758.</p>
							</authorialNote> is amended as follows.</p>
					</content>
				</paragraph>
				<paragraph GUID="_cbe43356-0a52-4ce5-ba80-eb18516765eb" class="prov2" eId="art_4__para_2">
					<num>(2)</num>
					<content>
						<p>In the Schedule (installations), in Part 1, omit the entry relating to “Curlew CUC-P1 Drill Site”.</p>
					</content>
				</paragraph>
			</article>
			<article GUID="_672c489c-6724-467d-9366-4a42fa58f998" class="prov1" eId="art_5"><?DMS-Component componentId="6df05e9d-dc50-42ea-a7d9-c5f55d8d9586" seriesId="81b97da6-7627-4ba3-9c56-bc13a1ed08c2" versionNumber="1"?>
				
				<heading GUID="_a6bb3e6d-8587-47a2-8480-7383c37ac385" eId="art_5__hdg">Amendment of the Offshore Installations (Safety Zones) (No. 2) Order 2016</heading>
				<num>5.</num>
				<paragraph GUID="_c68f7949-26ab-4ac5-81fc-2144ad4193b8" class="prov2" eId="art_5__para_1">
					<num>(1)</num>
					<content>
						<p>The Offshore Installations (Safety Zones) (No. 2) Order 2016<authorialNote GUID="_9062f93c-bf8e-4fc8-8ba5-35a4c8aab240" class="footnote" eId="fnote_6" marker="6">
								<p>S.I. 2016/623.</p>
							</authorialNote> is amended as follows.</p>
					</content>
				</paragraph>
				<paragraph GUID="_3907aaa3-3b0a-459b-8604-fd1ae0af1997" class="prov2" eId="art_5__para_2">
					<num>(2)</num>
					<content>
						<p>In the Schedule (installations), in Part 1, omit the entry relating to “Curlew Development, Block 29/7a, Curlew Field”.</p>
					</content>
				</paragraph>
			</article>
			<article GUID="_5ee48ac8-6177-421a-a8ca-714c184f80c7" class="prov1" eId="art_6"><?DMS-Component componentId="5ddd9659-2806-48d4-a862-bcb9fa9c8fa3" seriesId="8161b437-71b2-4628-88dd-7477329ca53f" versionNumber="1"?>
				
				<heading GUID="_4d6ef067-ed6e-4866-9055-811a8b61f5c2" eId="art_6__hdg">Amendment of the Offshore Installations (Safety Zones) (No. 3) Order 2017</heading>
				<num>6.</num>
				<paragraph GUID="_d7ae6f3c-5822-4857-aa25-389c95634e1f" class="prov2" eId="art_6__para_1">
					<num>(1)</num>
					<content>
						<p>The Offshore Installations (Safety Zones) (No. 3) Order 2017<authorialNote GUID="_cabe69ed-7523-4c2a-86d9-fe26d141baf8" class="footnote" eId="fnote_7" marker="7">
								<p>S.I. 2017/720.</p>
							</authorialNote> is amended as follows.</p>
					</content>
				</paragraph>
				<paragraph GUID="_d352a48e-d679-49bd-af0c-9f5e5d907e15" class="prov2" eId="art_6__para_2">
					<num>(2)</num>
					<content>
						<p>In the Schedule (installations), in Part 1, omit the entry relating to “Horne and Wren, Block 53/3c, Horne and Wren Field”.</p>
					</content>
				</paragraph>
			</article>
